  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GENERATIONS FOR PEACE FILM PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under UNSCR 2250, this project addresses the violence of exclusion and will engage youth in Jordan directly in production of a short film on an issue prioritised by youth, giving the participants high quality technical exposure to potential careers in the film industry and lifting up the voices of youth. Also providing a film product for wider advocacy engagement on the selected issue.</narrative>
